Garrick Textiles is a [[Org/Concordia|Concordia]] subsidiary that produces fabrics and clothing for the majority of Edan.

It began as an importer of raw cotton from [[Geography/Lorandris/index|Lorandris]], then bought up other importers in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]] and integrated into clothing manufacture, and is now the largest textile importer and clothing maker in [[Geography/Calaria/index|Calaria]]. It works in every kind of textile, including performance cloths, and took a commission from [[People/Benny|Benny]] for a sailcloth sports poncho.
